# CLAUDE.md

Use `docs/` as the project context source.

Read first:

- `docs/README.md`
- `docs/product/vision.md`
- `docs/architecture/overview.md`
- `docs/decisions/README.md`

When implementing a task:

- identify the owning layer first;
- reuse the existing Android/Backend boundary;
- prefer the smallest change that preserves current architecture;
- explain new dependency/configuration by role, reason, alternative, and location;
- add concise responsibility comments to new classes and non-obvious functions;
- do not treat roadmap items as already implemented;
- propose a Conventional Commit message after a meaningful development unit is complete.
